// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  Project Second Brain — signing configuration
//
//  1. Set DEVELOPMENT_TEAM to your Apple Developer Team ID
//     (Xcode › Settings › Accounts › your Apple ID › Team ID, 10 characters).
//  2. Change BASE_BUNDLE_ID to something unique to you, e.g. com.yourname.secondbrain
//  Everything else (widget bundle id, App Group) is derived from these two values.
//  See Docs/SIGNING.md for details.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
BASE_BUNDLE_ID = com.example.secondbrain
APP_GROUP_IDENTIFIER = group.$(BASE_BUNDLE_ID)
